@startuml F3.2-D04-operacao-pin-saida
title F3.2-D04 — Operação SECRET_DUAL (saída)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "EventController" as Ctrl
participant "AttendanceWindowUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Abrir janela saída
WebApp -> Jwt: POST .../windows/exit
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  Exige entrada concluída
  Inelegíveis sem entrada
end note
UC -> Postgres: abre saída
Postgres --> UC: OK + exitPin
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: PINDisplay saída

@enduml
